      },
      {
       "text": "$3b^{3}$",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Divide the coefficients: $15 \\div 5=3$. Also, $b^{3} \\div b=b^{2}$, so the answer is $3b^{2}$."
    },
    {
     "id": "1665d4ad-9f91-4ba6-8fa7-ed489194eef0",
